#: ../../examples/index.md:7 f0e95e285c004c80b000d2c88fa9ef57
msgid "In this section, you'll find practical examples showcasing how to use **Bookshelf**. Each example is designed as a mini-tutorial, demonstrating specific features and their real-world applications. The code provided can be easily converted into fully functional Minecraft datapacks thanks to **Lectern**, ensuring that everything in the documentation is directly applicable in-game."
msgstr "在本章节中，你将找到展示如何**高效运用Bookshelf**的实用示例。每个示例均设计为微型教程，演示特定功能及其实际应用场景。借助**Lectern**工具，所提供代码可轻松转换为功能完整的Minecraft数据包，确保文档中的所有内容都能直接在游戏中实现。"

